<?xml version="1.0" standalone="yes"?>

<!DOCTYPE PLUGIN [
<!ENTITY name      "smb-restart">
<!ENTITY author    "Maxwell Luong">
<!ENTITY version   "2026.08.04">
<!ENTITY pluginURL "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/maxandcheeses/unraid-restart-smb/main/smb-restart.plg">
<!-- The .txz is attached as a GitHub Release asset (tag vVERSION), not committed to main. -->
<!ENTITY pkgURL    "https://github.com/maxandcheeses/unraid-restart-smb/releases/download/v&version;/&name;-&version;-noarch.txz">
<!ENTITY pkgMD5    "0ca0b63a79f606db92e3e746183be5ac">
]>

<PLUGIN name="&name;" author="&author;" version="&version;" pluginURL="&pluginURL;" icon="images/smb-restart.png" min="6.9.0">

  <CHANGES>
###&version;
- New Plugins-page listing icon (1024x1024, black-on-white, folder+SMB with
  circular sync arrows) and a matching topbar nav-item icon (24x24,
  color-inverted to white-on-transparent so it stays visible against the
  dark navbar).

###2026.07.25.10
- Add a "Show icon in topbar" toggle on the Tools page. Uses the page
  Cond="..." mechanism, so when off, the nav-item button is not rendered at
  all (not just hidden) rather than patching or hacking anything. Takes
  effect on next page load/reload.

###2026.07.25.9
- Switch the nav-item icon to a transparent-background version of the same
  artwork, so it sits directly on the topbar instead of showing a black
  square behind it.

###2026.07.25.8
- New icon (two-tone circular sync arrows with "SMB" text), used for both
  the Plugins-page listing and the topbar nav-item button. The nav icon is
  24x24 rather than Unraid's usual 16x16 so the text/ring stay legible at
  that detail level.

###2026.07.25.7
- Refined Plugins-page icon: cleaner restart-arrow ring with "SMB" text
  below it (no overlap), still black background / white glyph.

###2026.07.25.6
- New Plugins-page icon: black rounded-square app icon with a white
  restart-arrow + "SMB" glyph.

###2026.07.25.5
- Add a confirmation dialog before restarting/starting SMB, on both the
  topbar button and the Tools page button. Text adapts to current state:
  "Restart SMB?" if it's running, "Start SMB?" if it's stopped, with a
  Cancel option that does nothing.
- Add a shipped README.md inside the plugin's own directory.

###2026.07.25.4
- Fix nav-item icon: resize to 16x16 (was 128x128, wildly oversized for the
  topbar) and switch to a colored disc glyph matching the convention used by
  Unraid's own icons (e.g. the power button), instead of a large flat
  black-on-white square.
- Add Code="f021" (fontawesome refresh icon) so the button still renders via
  Unraid's CSS ::before font-icon path at wide viewports (1330px+), where
  Unraid hides the image icon entirely and requires a Code-based icon instead.

###2026.07.25.3
- Replace the core-file-patching topbar hack with the real mechanism Unraid
  provides: a Menu="Buttons" page (SmbRestart.page), which renders as an
  actual nav-item button next to search/notifications/logout — the same way
  Unraid's own power button works. No patched core files anymore.

###2026.07.25.2
- Fix topbar-injection target and stop shipping macOS AppleDouble junk files
  (superseded by the 2026.07.25.3 rewrite above).

###2026.07.25.1
- Add plugin icon (shown on the Plugins page) and repo description.

###2026.07.25
- Initial release: restart/start SMB via a Tools page and a topbar status icon.
  </CHANGES>

  <FILE Name="/boot/config/plugins/&name;/&name;-&version;-noarch.txz" Min="6.9.0">
    <URL>&pkgURL;</URL>
    <MD5>&pkgMD5;</MD5>
  </FILE>

  <FILE Run="/bin/bash">
    <INLINE>
upgradepkg --install-new --reinstall /boot/config/plugins/&name;/&name;-&version;-noarch.txz
    </INLINE>
  </FILE>

  <FILE Run="/bin/bash" Method="remove">
    <INLINE>
removepkg &name;-&version;-noarch
rm -rf /boot/config/plugins/&name;
    </INLINE>
  </FILE>

</PLUGIN>
